      "title": "Gp Petroleums Limited Announces Re-Designation of Mr. Pradeep Kishore Mittal from the Position of Chief Executive Officer - Key Managerial Personnel (Ceo-Kmp) to Chief Executive Officer -­ Lubricants, Effective January 7, 2026",
      "body": "GP Petroleums Limited announced at the board meeting held on January 6, 2025, approved re-designated Mr. Pradeep Kishore Mittal from the position of Chief Executive Officer - Key Managerial Personnel (CEO-KMP) to Chief Executive Officer – Lubricants - Senior Management Personnel (CEO Lubricants – SMP) of the Company, with effect from January 7, 2026. This re-designation is intended to optimally leverage Mr. Mittal’s extensive experience and deep domain expertise in the lubricants business, enabling focused leadership and strategic oversight of the Lubricants vertical. Mr. Pradeep Kishore Mittal is a seasoned business leader with over 38 years of industry experience, including more than 25 years in senior leadership roles. He began his career with HPCL in Technical Services (1983–1993) and ",
